      "id": "claim_5104c32c52794acdba16078c886f3d53",
      "statement": "CIB is one of three reportable segments of Meridian Harbor (with CCB and AWM, plus a Corporate segment). It was formed in January 2025 by combining corporate and investment banking with commercial banking, and the integration of the former Commercial Banking segment was completed in 2025. It covers investment banking, markets, securities services, global payments and lending.",
