      "id": "claim_dff68d890bab441fb967bc0488a97c66",
      "statement": "For 2025 CIB reported net revenue of $32,450M, net income of $10,180M (up 6.5%), ROE of 18% on $54.0B average allocated equity, investment banking fees of $6,840M, Markets revenue of $17,920M, and provision of $820M. Its net income reconciles with the other segments to firmwide $24,960M.",
