      "id": "claim_b4b6cfae8c744c359d6fb6e1232788fe",
      "statement": "CIB payments growth depends on the Developer Platform APIs. The Payments Initiation API (API-03) and Real-Time Payments API (API-04) are integrated with the top five middle-market ERP platforms, and each payment is screened by the Fraud Risk Signals API (API-08) before release. The Wire Transfer API (API-05) serves CIB clients.",
