    {
      "id": "claim_4f9647d59f594e438795d4c92a3d00c8",
      "statement": "VaR is disclosed on two non-comparable bases. Management VaR in the Annual Report is 95% 1-day by historical simulation (2025 average total 50, 3 backtesting exceptions). Regulatory VaR in Pillar 3 is 99% 10-day (2025 average 160, 2 firmwide exceptions, below the five-exception threshold for a higher multiplier). The sources give no CIB-only VaR; it is a firmwide measure.",
