      "id": "claim_7bc6762e4b8542ba99b10ed6ac81751e",
      "statement": "Trading valuation and market-risk model inputs come from the Market Data API (API-12) and FX Rates API (API-13), which are designated BCBS 239 critical data elements and validated independently by the Valuation Control Group. Regulatory VaR, stressed VaR, IRC, the comprehensive risk measure and standardized specific risk make up market risk RWA of $54.2B at year end 2025.",
