    {
      "id": "claim_107cc5a1a78141a4b040b3e12ec19b6a",
      "statement": "Office CRE is the main credit concern in CIB. 2025 net charge-offs were concentrated in office CRE and a few consumer-discretionary C&I names. In 2Q26 office net charge-offs were $90M, criticized office loans were $3.1B (down from $3.6B), and office allowance coverage was 9.8%.",
